BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Frosé Saturdays
DTSTART:20260530T000000
DTEND:20260530T000000
UID:d7d09c7183b12aabe76f3947d73ed95e@adoberoadwines.com
DESCRIPTION:Frosé Fridays have been such a hit\, we are expanding now to 
 Saturday! With all this warm weather lately\, we’ve got the perfect thin
 g for you to cool off with at our Tasting Room in Downtown Petaluma. Our w
 inemaker\, Garrett Martin\, has crafted a refreshing new Frosé (frozen ro
 sé) made from our very own 2024 Sonoma County Rosé . We hope you love it
 ! Even better\, Inside Track Wine Club members enjoy additional club membe
 r pricing as well. Our frosé is available on Fridays and Saturdays\, whil
 e supplies last. Walk-ins welcome\, reservations recommended. Call or text
  (707) 774-6699 or use Tock to reserve online.
LOCATION:Adobe Road Tasting Room\, 6 Petaluma Blvd. N - Suite A1 Petaluma\
 , CA
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/frose-saturdays/
X-SOURCE:Adobe Road Winery
END:VEVENT
