BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma Summer Wine Stroll
DTSTART:20260607T000000
DTEND:20260607T000000
UID:ab2e2daa4a528363a7ed000ed729b4ad@adoberoadwines.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Adobe Road Winery and seven other local wine destinations
  for the second annual Petaluma Summer Wine Stroll . Stroll through Petalu
 ma’s charming historic district and taste each winery’s most popular s
 elections\, all within a half-mile walk. We’ll be pouring some of our fa
 vorite wines at the Adobe Road Tasting Room\, so be sure to stop by and sa
 y hello! The theme is Woodstock Uncorked \, so feel free to dress to impre
 ss. Come sip\, shop\, and celebrate the start of summer while supporting P
 etaluma’s unique local wine scene. Must be 21+ to taste. Please enjoy re
 sponsibly.
LOCATION:Adobe Road Tasting Room\, 6 Petaluma Blvd. N - Suite A1 Petaluma\
 , CA
URL:https://adoberoadwines.com/events/petaluma-summer-wine-stroll/
X-SOURCE:Adobe Road Winery
END:VEVENT
